<title>INDONESIA: Kiat 1996 net falls to 264.59 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Kiat 1996 net falls to 264.59 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>					 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			  264.59  vs  468.54</p>
<p>    Net sales			  1,812.48 vs 2,075.87</p>
<p>    Gross profit			617.25  vs  932.63</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  456.27  vs  814.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    265.88  vs  469.13</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		  298.56 vs  470.84</p>
<p>Note : The results were audited. PT Indah Kiat Pulp &amp; Paper Corporation, a member of conglomerate the Sinar Mas Group, is a pulp and paper maker.</p>
</text>
